		{"id":"legend","type":"text","x":0,"y":-280,"width":460,"height":210,"text":"**Legend**\n🟩 done · 🟨 now · ⬜ taught, not studied · 🟥 not taught yet · 🟪 midterm scope (in only if cumulative) · 🟧 shaky\nBuilt from the COURSE OUTLINE (27 Oct). Updated as material lands.\nH = Horngren 17e · M = Monvika 10e (Thai)"},
