		{"id":"ohs3","type":"text","text":"**Activity-based costing (ABC)**\ncost pools → drivers → products · who's under- or over-costed\nPast: 2021 final Q2 (undercosting)","x":900,"y":400,"width":460,"height":170},
		{"id":"oh","type":"text","text":"## Overhead allocation\nsessions 8–9 (28 Sep, 5 Oct) · H Ch 5 · M Ch 4","x":400,"y":205,"width":380,"height":160},
		{"id":"sds1","type":"text","text":"**Direct method**\nignore support-to-support services","x":900,"y":720,"width":460,"height":170},
		{"id":"sds2","type":"text","text":"**Step-down method**\nthe order you allocate in changes the answer","x":900,"y":920,"width":460,"height":170},
