		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":-80,"y":1250,"width":400,"height":280,"text":"# AC313 Final\n40% · **Mon 23 Nov, 09:00–12:00**\nTHE FIRST FINAL of the window (27 days)\nScope isn't stated in the outline: assume sessions 8–15 (guess, ask her)\nQuizzes & assignments = 20%"},
		{"id":"res","type":"text","x":-80,"y":1570,"width":400,"height":260,"text":"**Resources**\nDrive (a senior's, in `~/Desktop/pastpapers/AC313/`):\n· `AC313 Final2021.pdf` = 45 pages of screenshots of the 2021 ONLINE final (MCQ, 2 points each) + a worked copy\n  ⚠ no OCR on the Mac → Crow reads it page by page when we study\n· old AC203 midterm (AC203 = AC313's old code)\nOn disk: Course Package 1 only (midterm half). Package 2 = not yet","color":"5"},
